        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alexis Bledel, Dante Di Loreto\n- Films: The Good Guy, Violet & Daisy\n- Television Series: Will & Grace\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Alexis Bledel starred in the 2009 film The Good Guy.\n- Alexis Bledel also starred in the film Violet & Daisy.\n- Alexis Bledel won a Primetime Emmy Award for her work on the Hulu drama series The Handmaid's Tale.\n- Dante Di Loreto also won a Primetime Emmy Award.\n- Will & Grace is a television series, but it is not the Hulu drama series for which Alexis Bledel won the award.",
